<https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_sepsis_treatment> a holon:ClinicalQuestionHolon ;
    oe:questionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Sepsis?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Sepsis is heterogeneous, and the optimal strategy for tailoring immunotherapy is uncertain. To investigate whether precision immunotherapy guided by the presence of macrophage activation-like syndrome or sepsis-induced immunoparalysis improves organ dysfunction by day 9."^^xsd:string ;
